  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - Cte dIvoire Port Logistics Reverse Trade Mission, through Tuatara Group, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Cte dIvoire Port Logistics Reverse Trade Mission (RTM) will connect port sector representatives from Cte dIvoire with U.S. companies seeking to provide port technology and management operation services to the West African market. The RTM would showcase U.S. technologies and services to representatives from Cte dIvoire and expose participants to best-practices in port operations to support the implementation of improved port infrastructure in the Ports of Abidjan and San-Pedro.</narrative>
  </description>
